SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Songs for the Heart and Soul (May 21st)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us **on zoom** for a fun\, relaxing and inspiring evening with
  **Songs for the Heart and Soul!**\n\nYou will love what you hear! :)\nWon
 derful new songs every week!\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time aft
 er 8:30 pm (Eastern Time)\n\\*You are also welcome to come on later in the
  evening as well\n**\\*\\*Attend for free if you like - if it's your first
  time attending :)**\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemm
 ing\n(Songwriter/Producer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming's Song
 s for the Heart and Soul (May 21st)**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\n\\*Original Lyrics
  and Songs by Songwriter and Lyricist Steve Flemming\n\n\\*Story songs\, l
 ove songs\, spiritual songs\, and many other fun surprises!\n\nI'll be pla
 ying a mix of songs using a fusion of mixed genres like\, **Folk\, Traditi
 onal Folk\, Country\, Blue Grass\, Singer Song Writer\, Soft Rock\, Easy L
 istening\, Classic Rock\, R & B\, Gospel\, Pop\, Adult Contemporary\, Indi
 e Rock/Po**p and many others genres too. So please sit back and get ready 
 to have an amazing auditory experience in the comforts of your own home :)
 \n\n\\*You can come on and off at any time during the night- starting at 8
 :30 pm\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\nFree if it's your fi
 rst time attending online with me :)\n**Pay What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou
  can kindly send through e transfer or pay pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmai
 l.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute is greatly appreciated to help sup
 port this meaningful musical endeavor and song loving community\n\n\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zo
 om link:**\n\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Testimonials from Past Ev
 ents:**\n\nSteve Flemming is an amazing songwriter whose lyrics stir the s
 oul. He transforms everyday thoughts and life into beautiful poetry and ma
 gical tunes. Amazing stuff yet again Steve. - L.L.\nSteve\, thank you for 
 a night of heartfelt\, exhilarating\, and inspiring music.\nV.R.\nThanks f
 or having me my friend. I love your words\, they calm me and energize me a
 t the same time I'll look forward to your next invite\nM.Z.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-
