SUMMARY:Saturday Night with Friends! (Dinner\, Live Music and Dancing)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nPlease join us for a great evening as we mix\, mingle\, make new friend
 s\, dinner party and dance the night away with a fabulous Live Band!\n\n\\
 *Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous tu
 rn out with lots of friendly peers to enjoy dinner and the game\n\n**\\*Me
 et us inside Smoke Show between 6:00 pm and 8:00 pm**\n\\*If you have to a
 rrive after that\, still let the front door guy know you are with Steve's 
 group so he can direct you to us (but kindly do your best to arrive betwee
 n 6:00 pm and 7:30 pm (as I can't promise seating after that)-Thank you!\n
 \n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host 
 )\n\nEvent Details:\n**Saturday Night with Friends! (Dinner\, Live Music a
 nd Dancing)**\n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with friends\, food\, reserv
 ed seating\, Live Band and Dancing!\n-Pool Table available\n-Plenty of par
 king all around the venue and very close to Mt. Pleasant Station\n\n**Even
