 er/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n\n**IMPROV and ACTING in the PUB (with Optiona
 l Dinner Party After)**\n\nThis is a well organized event filled with Impr
 ov games\, skits and of course lots of hilarious scenes that we will creat
 e.\n-A fun afternoon for all Improv enthusiasts and newbies of Improv!\n\\
